 ## Background
-The VTK.js Transfer Function Interface originated as part of the VTK.js ecosystem, a JavaScript port of the Visualization Toolkit (VTK) [S1, unofficial][S2, unofficial]. It was developed to provide web-based volume rendering capabilities with interactive classification tools. The specific implementation is found in community repositories such as `caseywang777/VTKjsVolumeRendering` and `johanna-b/VisWeb` [S1, unofficial][S2, unofficial]. It leverages D3.js for the visual interface and Two.js for vector graphics rendering within the SVG context [S1, unofficial][S2, unofficial].
